  "final_validation_findings": [
    "All256 calibration, parameter and physical oracle controls pass. The shortcut fails every realization, with minimum hidden error .1583859 against .04.",
    "Actual local oracle7/7 and shortcut4pass/3hiddenfail confirm that failure is limited to finite-temperature physics.",
    "Final reference uses adaptive quadrature for the static free-energy term, preserving its independent small-positive-frequency impedance derivation.",
    "Calibration has192 independently noisy records; uncertainties depend only on the disclosed known separation. Public bounds agree with the stated plasma interval [4,9].",
    "Prediction caching is local to each predict_at call and keyed by all experiment controls, so it does not mix fitted parameters or change the physical model."
